<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stock market closes for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stock market closes for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan Stock Exchange will be closed on Friday and Saturday because of domestic holidays.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the weighted index gained 69.65 points or 1.08 percent to end at 6,508.17. Turnover was T$46.12 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
